Z||000008||pherder||08-31-2000||10:48 PM||||Stugood ... you should be "pun"ished!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Carrolles ... you have to have the part numbers ... I get them out of my 22P (Parts and Illustrations Manual)<P>Mrfixit58 ... take out the . at the end ... the URL is  <A HREF="http://www.gmpartsdirect.com" TARGET=_blank>www.gmpartsdirect.com</A> <P>theogre ... have tried Listine before and their online sysem sent me 10 sunroof gaskets, 10 right side dew wipes, and a bunch of other things that I only wanted one of ...  also, it seems to me that gmpartsdirect.com has better prices (except for S/H).<P>Paul<P>||||reg||1
